{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-3-1","title":"1 Corinthians 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Milk is fit for children. 3 Strife and division, arguments of a fleshly mind. 7 He that planteth and he that watereth, are nothing. 9 The ministers are God's fellow-workmen. 11 Christ the only foundation. 16 Men the temples of God, which must be kept holy. 19 The wisdom of this world is foolishness with God.</p>\n<p>as unto spiritual. 2:6,15; Ga 6:1 as unto carnal. 3,4; 2:14; Mt 16:23; Ro 7:14 babes. 14:20; Eph 4:13,14; 1Jo 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-2","title":"1 Corinthians 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>fed. Heb 5:12-14; 1Pe 2:2 for. Joh 16:12; Heb 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-3","title":"1 Corinthians 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>for whereas. 1:11; 6:1-8; 11:18; 2Co 12:20; Ga 5:15,19-21; Jas 3:16; 4:1,2 divisions. or, factions. and walk. Ho 6:7; Mr 7:21,22; Eph 2:2,3; 4:22-24; Tit 3:3; 1Pe 4:2 as men. Gr. according to man.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-4","title":"1 Corinthians 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>1:12; 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-5","title":"1 Corinthians 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>ministers. 7; 4:1,2; Lu 1:2; Ro 10:14,15; 2Co 3:6; 4:5,7; 6:1,4; 11:23 even. 10; 9:17; 12:4-11,28; Mt 25:15; Joh 3:27; Ro 12:3-6; 1Pe 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-6","title":"1 Corinthians 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I. 9,10; 4:14,15; 9:1,7-11; 15:1-11; Ac 18:4-11; 2Co 10:14,15 Apollos. Pr 11:25; Ac 18:24,26,27; 19:1 God. 1:30; 15:10; Ps 62:9,11; 92:13-15; 127:1; Isa 55:10,11; 61:11 Ac 11:18; 14:27; 16:14; 21:19; Ro 15:18; 2Co 3:2-5; 1Th 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-7","title":"1 Corinthians 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>13:2; Ps 115:1; Isa 40:17; 41:29; Da 4:35; Joh 15:5; 2Co 12:9; Ga 6:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-8","title":"1 Corinthians 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he that planteth. 9; 4:6; Joh 4:36-38 and every. 4:5; 9:17,18; 15:58; Ps 62:12; Da 12:3; Mt 5:11,12; 10:41,42; 16:27 Ro 2:6; Ga 6:7,8; Heb 6:10; 1Pe 5:4; 2Jo 1:8; Re 2:23; 22:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-9","title":"1 Corinthians 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>we. 6; Mt 9:37; Mr 16:20; 2Co 6:1; 3Jo 1:8 ye are God's. Ps 65:9-13; 72:16; 80:8-11; Isa 5:1-7; 27:2,3; 28:24-29; 32:20 Isa 61:3,5,11; Jer 2:21; Mt 13:3-9,18-30,36-42; 20:1-14; 21:23-44 Mr 4:26-29; Joh 4:35-38; 15:1-8 husbandry. or, tillage. ye are God's building. 16; 6:19; Ps 118:22; Am 9:11,12; Zec 6:12,13; Mt 16:18; Ac 4:11 2Co 6:16; Eph 2:10,20-22; Col 2:7; 1Ti 3:15; Heb 3:3,4,6; 1Pe 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-10","title":"1 Corinthians 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>to the. 5; 15:10; Ro 1:5; 12:3; 15:15; Eph 3:2-8; Col 1:29; 1Ti 1:11-14 1Pe 4:11 as a. 1Ki 3:9-11; 2Ch 2:12; Da 12:3; Mt 7:24; 24:45; 2Ti 2:15 I have. 6,11; 9:2; Zec 4:9; Ro 15:20; Eph 2:20; Re 21:14,19 and another. 15:11,12; Ac 18:27; 2Co 10:15; 11:13-15 But let every. Ec 12:9; Lu 11:35; 21:8; Col 4:17; 1Ti 4:16; Jas 3:1; *Gr: 1Pe 4:11; 2Pe 2:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-11","title":"1 Corinthians 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Isa 28:16; Mt 16:18; Ac 4:11,12; 2Co 11:2-4; Ga 1:7-9; Eph 2:20 2Ti 2:19; 1Pe 2:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-12","title":"1 Corinthians 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>gold. Ps 19:10; 119:72; Pr 8:10; 16:16; Isa 60:17; 1Ti 4:6; 2Ti 2:20 1Pe 1:7; Re 3:18 precious. Isa 54:11-13; Re 21:18 wood. Pr 30:6; Jer 23:28; Mt 15:6-9; Ac 20:30; Ro 16:17; 2Co 2:17; 4:2 Col 2:8,18-23; 1Ti 4:1-3,7; 6:3; 2Ti 2:16-18; 3:7,13; 4:3 Tit 1:9-11; 3:9-11; Heb 13:9; Re 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-13","title":"1 Corinthians 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>man's. 14,15; 4:5; 2Ti 3:9 the day. 1:8; Mal 3:17; Ro 2:5,16; 2Th 1:7-10; 2Ti 1:18; 2Pe 3:10; Re 20:12 shall be revealed. Gr. is revealed. Lu 2:35 and the fire. Isa 8:20; 28:17; Jer 23:29; Eze 13:10-16; Zec 13:9; 1Pe 1:7; 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-14","title":"1 Corinthians 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>8; 4:5; Da 12:3; Mt 24:45-47; 25:21-23; 1Th 2:19; 2Ti 4:7; 1Pe 5:1,4 Re 2:8-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-15","title":"1 Corinthians 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>work. 12,13; Re 3:18 he shall. Ac 27:21,44; 2Jo 1:8 yet. Am 4:11; Zec 3:2; 1Pe 4:18; Jude 1:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-3-16","title":"1 Corinthians 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Know. 5:6; 6:2,3,9,16,19; 9:13,24; Ro 6:3; Jas 4:4 ye are. 2Co 6:16; Eph 2:21,22; Heb 3:6; 1Pe 2:5 the Spirit. Eze 36:27; Joh 14:1