k-1co-3-23","title":"1 Corinthians 3:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>ye. 6:19,20; 7:22; 15:23; Joh 17:9,10; Ro 14:8; 2Co 10:7; Ga 3:29; 5:24 and Christ. 8:6; 11:3; Mt 17:5; Joh 17:18,21; Eph 1:10; Php 2:8-11</p>"}]}